@4    = ~Strange Squirrel~
@5    = ~Cloak~
@6    = ~Estelin's Intent~
@7    = ~This enchanted cloak was Estelin's first attempt at changing his world. But the enchantment wore off quicker than he liked, and so he decided to go for a more permanent solution. He was happy to give it to you--after all, he doesn't need it anymore. This cloak lets you polymorph into a squirrel once per day and doesn't disable your spellcasting.

STATISTICS: 

Equipped abilities: 
- Armor Class: +1

Charge ability (1x per day): 
- Disguise into Squirrel for 2 turns

Weight: 3~
@8    = ~Claws~
@9    = ~These claws are sharp!~
